# Keep repository guidance pages out of the docs_bundle mounted into reference_integration.
# When reference_integration builds the docs, its own conf.py is used, so the exclude_patterns of
# this repository's conf.py do not apply there. These files are only meant for readers browsing
# the repository on GitHub, are not part of the product documentation, and their GitHub-only
# relative links cause Sphinx warnings, so they are not needed in the docs_bundle.
# This also covers the other README.md files and the reference.md files of the test vectors
# (score/tests/test_vectors), which are out of scope for reference_integration for now. The test
# vectors may become relevant for it in the future. The same applies to the DEMO.md of the
# integration tests (score/tests/integration_tests), which only describes how to run the demo.
**/CONTRIBUTION.md
**/DEMO.md
**/README.md
**/reference.md
